!! shows ~ survey · every-blob · fetch-one · hold-one · free-one · sweep-dry

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`survey` params=`~ blobs, referenced, unreferenced, pending and bytes`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`every-blob` params=`all/true ~ list each blob`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`fetch-one` params=`fetch/<cid> ~ read one cid through the vessel's fetch door`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`hold-one` params=`pin/<cid> holder/review ~ hold a blob past the grace until released`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`free-one` params=`release/<cid> ~ free a held blob`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`sweep-dry` params=`sweep/true dry-run/true ~ name the unreferenced blobs past their grace and move nothing`>>
```

